{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2022-06-16 02:00:00', 'title': 'PUNTA CANA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT SELECTS LEIDOS AS AIRPORT CHECKPOINT TECHNOLOGY PROVIDER', 'text': "RESTON, VA. , JUNE 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEIDOS (NYSE:LDOS), A FORTUNE® 500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER, WAS SELECTED BY THE DOMINICAN REPUBLIC'S PUNTA CANA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (PUJ) TO UPGRADE THEIR SECURITY CHECKPOINTS."}